{"exps":[{"para":{"tag":"tag_1"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"scaleX":1.5,"trans":true,"layer":"bg","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"bright":1,"scaleY":1.5,"x":-500,"mirrow":false,"y":-125,"img":"bgblack","addImg":""},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"alpha":0.4,"scaleX":1.5,"trans":true,"layer":"bg","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"bright":1,"transTime":300,"scaleY":1.5,"x":-500,"mirrow":false,"y":-125,"img":"bgblack","addImg":""},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_2"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"bright":1,"scaleY":1,"x":426,"mirrow":false,"y":-34,"img":"chara014_1","addImg":"chara014_1_face_chara014_1a"},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"bright":1,"transTime":300,"scaleY":1,"x":426,"mirrow":false,"y":-34,"img":"chara014_1","addImg":"chara014_1_face_chara014_1a"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"皮塔","text":"[show]我们村子跟外界封闭，环境不好，生活也不富裕。和这个营地完全没法比。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_3"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"皮塔","text":"[show]不怕你会觉得我们像一群占山为王的山匪，但算上劫掠，村子也不过只能保证基本的温饱而已。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_4"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2","img":"chara014_1_face_chara014_1f"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"皮塔","text":"[show]你说和驿站合作，为村子提供物资？其实……在几年前，兽潮发生的时候，我们也尝试过与外界联手，共同抗灾。结果魔物大军尾随盟友而来，村子几乎全灭。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_5"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2","img":"chara014_1_face_chara014_1e"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"皮塔","text":"[show]自那之后，我们就变得非常保守固执了。虽然确实还有与外界合作的事情，但我们还是更倾向各自占山为王保全自己。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_6"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"皮塔","text":"[show]连自给自足都无法保证的小聚落，根本没有尝试改变生活方式的成本。[r]这就是为什么巴诺姆村至今还如此排外，没有再试着跟任何势力交流。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_7"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2","img":"chara014_1_face_chara014_1f"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"皮塔","text":"[show]或许以后会有改变的可能吧，不过那不是我这个小角色能控制的了。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"}],"des":"皮塔-熟识","script":"yd_014_06"}